dnshost.test.      SOA    ns1.dnshost.test. hostmaster.dnshost.test. 1 3600 600 604800 300
dnshost.test.      NS     ns1.dnshost.test.
dnshost.test.      NS     ns2.dnshost.test.
ns1.dnshost.test.  A      10.53.@N@.11
ns2.dnshost.test.  A      10.53.@N@.12
edge.dnshost.test. A      10.53.@N@.83
